#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PLUGIN.rst:2
msgid "CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PLUGIN"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PLUGIN.rst:6
msgid ""
"Specifies a FASTBuild cache plugin in the generated file: the path of a "
"shared library that FASTBuild loads to store and retrieve cached artifacts "
"in place of its own cache directory (the ``.CachePluginDLL`` setting)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PLUGIN.rst:10
msgid ""
"FASTBuild passes :variable:`CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PATH`, or the "
"``FASTBUILD_CACHE_PATH`` environment variable, "
"and :variable:`CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PLUGIN_CONFIG` to the plugin. As with "
"its own cache, FASTBuild uses the plugin only in a build with caching "
"enabled: see :variable:`CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_MODE`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_FASTBUILD_CACHE_PLUGIN.rst:16
msgid ""
"See the `FASTBuild caching documentation <https://www.fastbuild.org/docs/"
"features/caching.html>`_ for more information."
msgstr ""
